Thank you for installing Tyk Data Plane Chart. Your release is named tyk.
At this point, Tyk Data Plane is fully installed and should be accessible.

To quickly test everything is ok, you can port-forward gateway pod to 8080 on your machine :
    kubectl port-forward service/gateway-svc-tyk-tyk-gateway 8080:8080
    curl localhost:8080/hello

=== API Secret (TYK_GW_SECRET) ===
    export TYK_GW_SECRET=$(kubectl get secret --namespace tyk-dp secrets-tyk-tyk-data-plane -o jsonpath="{.data.APISecret}" | base64 --decode)

